WEBVTT

00:03:28.615 --> 00:03:30.855
A molecule is not just a molecule.

00:03:30.879 --> 00:03:33.633
It can mean different things
depending on the context,

00:03:34.404 --> 00:03:37.346
just like the crying of babies
can mean different things:

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.140
sometimes the baby is hungry,

00:03:39.164 --> 00:03:40.358
sometimes it's wet,

00:03:40.382 --> 00:03:42.401
sometimes it's hurt or afraid.

00:03:42.425 --> 00:03:44.775
Parents know how to decode those cries.

00:03:45.624 --> 00:03:47.506
And to be a real translation tool,

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:50.503
it had to be able to decode
the signaling molecules

00:03:50.527 --> 00:03:54.588
and translate them
depending on the context.

00:03:55.497 --> 00:03:56.648
And who knows?

00:03:56.672 --> 00:03:58.833
Maybe Google Translate
will adopt this soon.

00:03:58.857 --> 00:04:01.226
(Laughter)